   "color": "4",
   "text": "### T-002#B-002\n真模型验收：判官确实能分出两类\n\n`done` · @-\n\ntests/triage/acceptance.py 按 scan 的形状造 judge-input-bodies.json，跑 triage.py，逐条比 expected.json，并断言 routed 只剩 general、非 general 都带非空 memory 载荷。真调 ~/.hermes/dream-j"
