   "text": "### T-004#B-003\n清理 worktree 与临时证据\n\n`done` · @-\n\n从主 clone 侧 git worktree remove ../Dream.wt-triage → 删分支 judge-triage-gate → worktree prune；tests/ 的临时产物不留（acceptance.py 默认自删临时目录）。"
